            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1f2933' fontname='Georgia' fontsize='20'>Higher rates, not just prices, doubled the monthly payment</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#1f2933' fontname='Trebuchet MS' fontsize='11'>Estimated payment on a typical home rose 106% while home values rose 49%; burdens are heaviest in the West and Northeast.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </title>
      </layout-options>
