                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1f2933' fontname='Trebuchet MS' fontsize='9'>Method: </run>
                <run fontcolor='#1f2933' fontname='Trebuchet MS' fontsize='9'>principal &amp; interest, 20% down, 30-year fixed at that month’s average rate. Payment-to-income = annual P&amp;I ÷ county median income; 30% = standard cost-burden line (CRS, 2024).</run>
              </formatted-text>
